00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:25.929
Dr. Karan Mittal: healing, of going deeper, of relaxation. So that's the parasympathetic nervous system. Now, imagine religious practices or spiritual practices that need to activate the parasympathetic nervous system, that is relaxation, calmness, etc, are now activating the sympathetic nervous system. A person is so stressed about waking up at 4am in the morning, doing his particular practices, then rushing to the office, then being so very rigid about

127
00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:42.190
