375
01:03:48.320 --> 01:04:02.300
GOVINDA Das: And for some people, it may say, Ithna patients, when will you… when will you exhibit that potential, right? It is so fascinating, it is so amazing. You know, it's not that this one is right, or that one is right.

376
01:04:02.900 --> 01:04:13.439
