377
01:04:13.960 --> 01:04:15.650
GOVINDA Das: It was a great exercise.

378
01:04:15.820 --> 01:04:19.749
GOVINDA Das: Good to see. So, the irony of faith

379
01:04:20.910 --> 01:04:28.910
GOVINDA Das: Right? The… another interesting principle of Bharati, which are the Indian Knowledge System.

380
01:04:29.500 --> 01:04:32.640
GOVINDA Das: It is called as the duality, dwandua.

381
01:04:33.210 --> 01:04:40.939
GOVINDA Das: Right? In the Mahabharat, one of the most fascinating discussion happens between Yujishthin and Arjun.

382
01:04:43.690 --> 01:04:47.989
GOVINDA Das: And one… Point Arjuna tells you this to the Maharaj.

383
01:04:48.440 --> 01:04:51.649
GOVINDA Das: He says, my dear brother, in this world.

384
01:04:52.010 --> 01:04:55.499
GOVINDA Das: There is nothing which is completely positive.

385
01:04:57.710 --> 01:05:01.569
GOVINDA Das: And he says, there is nothing which is completely negative.

386
01:05:02.050 --> 01:05:06.260
GOVINDA Das: Every positive has a seed of negativity.

387
01:05:06.910 --> 01:05:11.060
GOVINDA Das: And every negativity has the seed of positivity.

388
01:05:11.570 --> 01:05:18.209
GOVINDA Das: Very important to understand this principle. Nothing in this world which is completely positive.

389
01:05:19.130 --> 01:05:24.510
GOVINDA Das: even the Amrita, became death to Rahu and Ketu.

390
01:05:26.700 --> 01:05:34.830
GOVINDA Das: And the poison for Bhima, Gave him the strength of 10,000 elephants.

391
01:05:35.260 --> 01:05:45.129
GOVINDA Das: He was sped poison by Duryodhan, and he was thrown into the water. He was… he landed into Nagaloka, and the snakes in the Nagaloka, they bit him.

392
01:05:45.580 --> 01:05:50.000
GOVINDA Das: So rather than dying by the bite of the snake, it becomes antidote.

393
01:05:50.970 --> 01:05:51.910
GOVINDA Das: Alright?

394
01:05:52.180 --> 01:05:55.120
GOVINDA Das: Now, it may be… it may be a story.

395
01:05:55.260 --> 01:06:00.449
GOVINDA Das: But if you see, apply this logic in every aspect of life.

396
01:06:01.500 --> 01:06:06.710
GOVINDA Das: There is nothing which gives rise to complete positivity or complete negativity.

397
01:06:07.810 --> 01:06:14.970
GOVINDA Das: Similarly fit… Faith without dharma… It's like a gambling match.

398
01:06:16.750 --> 01:06:23.560
GOVINDA Das: Alright? I remember talking to one couple, And the husband told me…

399
01:06:24.320 --> 01:06:29.839
GOVINDA Das: You know, the path of spirituality which I chose, it has made me a human being.

400
01:06:32.140 --> 01:06:34.409
GOVINDA Das: And the path which my wife

401
01:06:34.660 --> 01:06:45.270
GOVINDA Das: chose, same path they chose, both of them, they chose the same path. For a man, it became very beneficial, but for a wife, it ruined her progressive life.

402
01:06:46.310 --> 01:06:48.799
GOVINDA Das: It was very interesting when I heard that first time.

403
01:06:49.580 --> 01:06:53.299
GOVINDA Das: So, therefore, when we study the irony of faith is…

404
01:06:54.280 --> 01:06:59.030
GOVINDA Das: Like, they say, what is the distinction between genius and a madman?

405
01:06:59.920 --> 01:07:03.600
GOVINDA Das: It is a thin line difference. Similarly, faith is like that.

406
01:07:04.280 --> 01:07:12.799
GOVINDA Das: Right? Faith is extremely beneficial At the same time, it is dangerous beyond limit.

407
01:07:16.000 --> 01:07:21.269
GOVINDA Das: we have to reflect… we have to reflect upon this. You know, you see many places…

408
01:07:22.010 --> 01:07:30.679
GOVINDA Das: That when you… when you see, when you study the stories of The… the extreme religious ideas

409
01:07:31.560 --> 01:07:46.019
