414
01:08:09.770 --> 01:08:17.260
GOVINDA Das: That the parents who raised you nicely, they give you education, they may not be practicing what you practice.

415
01:08:17.560 --> 01:08:20.360
GOVINDA Das: You are confident that they'll go to hell?

416
01:08:20.729 --> 01:08:25.680
GOVINDA Das: She said, yes, if they don't practice what I practice, because this is the highest in life.

417
01:08:25.859 --> 01:08:32.229
GOVINDA Das: You know, it doesn't matter even if they're their parents, I love them, but their destination is health.

418
01:08:34.430 --> 01:08:36.319
GOVINDA Das: the great Shivaji Maharaj.

419
01:08:36.660 --> 01:08:46.409
GOVINDA Das: Right? After his departure, One of the priests wrote to the Portuguese queen. That letter is actually recorded.

420
01:08:47.000 --> 01:08:51.139
GOVINDA Das: Glorifying all the good qualities of Shivaji Maharaj.

421
01:08:52.270 --> 01:09:01.169
GOVINDA Das: But what is the conclusion of that letter? The conclusion of that letter is, because he practiced the pagan religion, he has to go to the hell.

422
01:09:02.430 --> 01:09:09.120
GOVINDA Das: Imagine, right, you're glorifying good qualities, but in your mind, you are sending them to hell.

423
01:09:09.930 --> 01:09:20.199
GOVINDA Das: So there… it is extremely beneficial, it is dangerous beyond limit, therefore what Arjuna said is an extremely important, therefore one has to think critically.

424
01:09:21.770 --> 01:09:27.420
GOVINDA Das: Thinking critically becomes… thinking critically does not mean acting.

425
01:09:27.760 --> 01:09:34.510
GOVINDA Das: In the way of slandering and criticizing, think critically, Feel naturally.

426
01:09:35.620 --> 01:09:40.509
GOVINDA Das: Like, in one of the rooms, One participant explained.

427
