431
01:10:05.960 --> 01:10:12.429
GOVINDA Das: At least nowadays, people are at least thinking about me time, because thinking me time for a mother

432
01:10:12.540 --> 01:10:18.190
GOVINDA Das: Was seen as an extremely artificial and selfish thing to do.

433
01:10:19.470 --> 01:10:27.800
GOVINDA Das: Their identity as me was completely destroyed. Her identity was only a mother.

434
01:10:28.360 --> 01:10:31.310
GOVINDA Das: Right? So, this is an artificial reality.

435
01:10:31.670 --> 01:10:37.770
GOVINDA Das: So, think critically, Feel naturally and act strategically.

436
01:10:37.920 --> 01:10:44.880
GOVINDA Das: That is what gives rise to healthy shraddha, which is deeper.

437
01:10:45.030 --> 01:10:52.940
GOVINDA Das: Which is inner experience, and creates a profound vibration to those In our surrounding.

