444
01:11:13.000 --> 01:11:15.389
Dr. Karan Mittal: Does this belief allow me to doubt it?

445
01:11:16.080 --> 01:11:22.209
Dr. Karan Mittal: If no, then, of course, maybe you could just ask, answer the questions for yourself, and then we'll discuss it.

446
01:11:22.310 --> 01:11:27.849
Dr. Karan Mittal: Does it require me to see others as inferior? Like, in one of the breakout rooms, someone said that

