454
01:12:35.130 --> 01:12:54.719
Dr. Karan Mittal: So, there's a continuum that exists between white and black, between yes and no. And sometimes when we are rigidly associated with one particular belief, we try to impose that belief on others, we try to make that belief harsh for ourselves, we try to kind of impose it on our family, that kind of spoils the relationship with our family, so…

455
01:12:54.720 --> 01:13:01.439
Dr. Karan Mittal: So someone said that he has a particular belief about religious principles, and he tries, and he expects that from the family.

456
01:13:01.630 --> 01:13:10.890
Dr. Karan Mittal: And when he expects that from the family, it kind of hampers the relationship between him and parents, kids, wife, etc.

457
01:13:10.940 --> 01:13:22.969
Dr. Karan Mittal: Another client of mine who follows a spiritual tradition married a particular person with the condition that he will also switch into the spiritual tradition eventually.

