01:15:31.510 --> 01:15:38.430
GOVINDA Das: one, IT person, he wrote a book on mind in a Marathi, it's in a Marathi book, it's a Marathi book.

479
01:15:39.070 --> 01:15:42.290
GOVINDA Das: And he explains, giving the full history about

480
01:15:43.010 --> 01:15:47.250
