01:15:55.440 --> 01:15:57.210
GOVINDA Das: There were chairs.

483
01:15:57.780 --> 01:16:08.290
GOVINDA Das: They would think that because their mind is not proper, it is not spinning properly, they would be put in a moving chair, and it would move so hard.

484
01:16:08.890 --> 01:16:14.260
GOVINDA Das: And sometimes they put them upside down, sometimes actually remove blood from their body.

