GOVINDA Das: It's not the spirituality itself is the problem, it is the person who's practicing spirituality.

816
01:54:19.310 --> 01:54:25.000
GOVINDA Das: If they feel there is a story told by one very great saint, Pajar Swami.

817
01:54:25.370 --> 01:54:28.749
GOVINDA Das: You know, he recently passed away, extremely…

818
01:54:29.200 --> 01:54:32.649
GOVINDA Das: great soul. He said, one time.

819
01:54:33.300 --> 01:54:37.459
GOVINDA Das: How Brahman was doing his Gayatri without fail, never missed his Gayatri.

820
01:54:38.840 --> 01:54:42.700
GOVINDA Das: And one day, he got up late.

821
01:54:42.950 --> 01:54:44.649
GOVINDA Das: He could not get up only.

822
01:54:45.200 --> 01:54:52.760
GOVINDA Das: And Kali personified, Kali, Kali personified, woke him up. Ari, come on, get up, get up! You have to perform your Gayatri.

823
01:54:53.240 --> 01:55:02.920
GOVINDA Das: And this Brahmana got up immediately and took fast bath, and he performed his Gayatra, he felt satisfied. And then he was shocked, how is that Kali woke me up?

824
01:55:03.660 --> 01:55:09.559
GOVINDA Das: Then he asked the Kali, why, why you woke me up? He said, because you'll have the pride of never missing your Gayatri.

825
01:55:11.600 --> 01:55:12.590
GOVINDA Das: Alright?

826
01:55:12.710 --> 01:55:18.800
GOVINDA Das: Sometime the purity itself becomes a contamination. I'm so pure, others are very impure.

827
01:55:20.340 --> 01:55:24.579
GOVINDA Das: So, therefore, yes, That strong sadhana

828
01:55:24.970 --> 01:55:30.070
GOVINDA Das: Has the power to give rise to ahankar instead of confidence.

829
01:55:30.670 --> 01:55:33.099
GOVINDA Das: When confidence and ankh are.

830
01:55:33.500 --> 01:55:46.299
GOVINDA Das: are working very close to each other, rather than Atma Vishwas, it can lead to ahankar, and Ahankar, what does it do? It basically makes one feel inferior to others.

831
01:55:46.440 --> 01:55:56.879
GOVINDA Das: Therefore, when Krishna, Lord Ram, beautiful story of Lord Ram, when he was riding with Mathali, the Indrush chariot driver.

832
01:55:57.860 --> 01:56:01.549
GOVINDA Das: While the Battle of Ram Raman was going on.

833
01:56:02.290 --> 01:56:07.930
GOVINDA Das: And then Lord Ram realized, actually, he's not my chariot driver, he's Indra's chariot driver.

834
01:56:08.130 --> 01:56:10.769
GOVINDA Das: So, therefore, he said, sorry, I was pushing you.

835
01:56:11.950 --> 01:56:19.430
GOVINDA Das: So, Ram was humble enough to say, so therefore, yes, Sadhana… is very important.

836
01:56:19.950 --> 01:56:24.500
GOVINDA Das: But the flip side of that sadhana is that one can become arrogant.

837
01:56:24.890 --> 01:56:31.520
GOVINDA Das: Overconfident, and undermine others' position, and becomes spiritually fanatic.

838
01:56:34.660 --> 01:56:36.980
Dr. Karan Mittal: To Ramji, you can ask the question.

839
01:56:36.980 --> 01:56:40.480
